prompt_template:
Create one finished editorial art poster, aspect ratio {ASPECT_RATIO}, full bleed. Visual system: analog photographic collage with restless ivory cut-paper typography and selective square displacement. Prioritized style anchors: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Design intention and ratio plans: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Print exactly the main headline "{MAIN_TEXT}" and supporting line "{SECONDARY_TEXT}". Render the headline in huge heavy warm ivory sans-serif cut letters with playful individual rotations and shifted baselines, all glyphs readable. Supporting copy is small white sans-serif. No other text.
Surface treatment: Fine embossed paper fibers across the whole poster at moderate strength, delicate pale vertical and horizontal ruling, visible coarse halftone dots in selected dark/photo regions. Intentionally slightly soft warm analog photo highlights and crisp square-cut tile boundaries. No thick dirt, extreme aging or indiscriminate digital noise.
Source content to replace and exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
Keep recognizable photographic forms, strong hierarchy, deliberate negative space and exact text. No branding, watermark, QR code, decorative logos, fake UI or framing mockup. One image only.
